  "_configurations":"LRU is --mlc_cache_repl_policy 0. Replay configs read mlp_oracle_google_ref_t3/track's record (--mlp_oracle_ref). The *_ro configs and cold_check (c8bb06d) add mlp_oracle_reuse_only: 5f06591's modes 2/3 also forced cold misses, which no replacement policy can save.",
  "configurations":{
    "lru":{
      "_params":"baseline",
      "params":"--mlc_cache_repl_policy 0 --inst_limit 550000000",
      "binary":"scarab_5f06591",
      "slurm_options":"",
      "memory_overhead_mb":64
    },
    "mlp64":{
      "_params":"REPL_MLP gamma_i 64, gamma_d 0",
